===================================================
    
Case 1: a constant format     

===================================================
to_number('12.34', '99.99')    
12.34     

===================================================
to_number('1.5', '9.9')    to_number('123.456', '999.999')    
1.5     123.456     

===================================================
to_number(s, '999.999')    
7.000     
12.340     
123.456     

===================================================
    
Case 2: a format per row     

===================================================
to_number(s, f)    
7     
12.34     
123.456     

===================================================
s    to_number(s, f)    
12.34     12.34     
123.456     123.456     
7     7     

===================================================
sum( to_number(s, f))    max( to_number(s, f))    min( to_number(s, f))    
142.796     123.456     7     

===================================================
    
